<title>AUSTRIA: VA Tech H1 pre-tax surges 50 pct.</title>
<headline>VA Tech H1 pre-tax surges 50 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of schillings unless stated)</p>
<p>						     1996	   1995</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit				484   vs     322</p>
<p>    Net profit				    378   vs     294</p>
<p>    Sales					12,212   vs   9,268</p>
<p>    Workforce				  15,259   vs  14,624</p>
<p>    Order intake			     20,301   vs  16,981</p>
<p>    Order backlog			    75,964   vs  63,566</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is VA Technologie AG. Analysts had expected a pre-tax profit of around 370 million schillings and net profit of some 300 million schillings.</p>
<p>-- Julia Ferguson, Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 254</p>
</text>
